esia","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"manta cleaning station","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Sangeang Volcano sites","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"volcanic-slope diving, bubbling sand","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","commission_path":"fleet-direct","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","timing":"May-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"volcanic-slope diving, bubbling sand","when":"May-Oct","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Gili Lawa Laut","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"comfort","hook":"northern reef and ridge","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","commission_path":"fleet-direct","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","timing":"May-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"northern reef and ridge","when":"May-Oct","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Gili Banta","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"outer current site","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","commission_path":"fleet-direct","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","timing":"May-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"outer current site","when":"May-Oct","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Moyo Island","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"comfort","hook":"reposition-leg reef","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","commission_path":"fleet-direct","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","timing":"May-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"reposition-leg reef","when":"May-Oct","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Satonda","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"comfort","hook":"crater-lake island stop","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","commission_path":"fleet-direct","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","timing":"May-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"crater-lake island stop","when":"May-Oct","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Padar","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"comfort","hook":"three-bay viewpoint island","bookable_category":"liveaboard berth","commission_path":"fleet-direct","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","timing":"May-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"three-bay viewpoint island","when":"May-Oct","commission":"fleet-direct"},{"name":"Central Komodo current-pinnacle route","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"Castle/Crystal Rock + Gili Lawa, dry-season","bookable_category":"liveaboard week","commission_path":"fleet-direct (Aggressor)","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","timing":"May-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"Castle/Crystal Rock + Gili Lawa, dry-season","when":"May-Oct","commission":"fleet-direct (Aggressor)"},{"name":"Southern manta route","si_tag":"liveaboard","status":"live","tier":"premier","hook":"Manta Alley + southern reefs","bookable_category":"liveaboard week","commission_path":"fleet-direct (Aggressor)","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","si":"liveaboard","blurb":"Manta Alley + southern reefs","commission":"fleet-direct (Aggressor)"},{"name":"Komodo National Park dragon walk + Padar","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"comfort","hook":"ranger-guided dragons on Komodo/Rinca + Padar viewpoint","bookable_category":"liveaboard-included park day / DMC","commission_path":"DMC (park fee pass-through)","source":"https://www.liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","timing":"May-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"adventure","blurb":"ranger-guided dragons on Komodo/Rinca + Padar viewpoint","when":"May-Oct","commission":"DMC (park fee pass-through)"}],"faq":[{"q":"What is the current advisory for Komodo, and how do I dive it responsibly?","a":"The U.S. State Department places Indonesia at Level 2 - Exercise Increased Caution (reissued 30 April 2025). Its only Level 4 (Do Not Travel) carve-outs are Central Papua (Papua Tengah) and Highland Papua (Papua Pegunungan), for civil unrest; Komodo, in East Nusa Tenggara, sits well apart from both. The material regional flag comes from the UK FCDO, which advises against all travel within 7 km of the crater of Mount Lewotobi Laki-Laki on Flores - a volcano that erupted on 17 June 2025, holds Indonesia''s highest alert (level 4), and carries mud/debris-flow warnings plus disruption to flights to and from Bali and Flores. Because Labuan Bajo, Komodo''s gateway, is on Flores, build slack into flight connections and confirm status before travel. Carry DAN membership plus separate dive-accident insurance and observe an 18-24 hour no-fly window after diving.","source":"travel.state.gov/en/international-travel/travel-advisories/indonesia.html + gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia/regional-risks (both accessed 2026-08-09)","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is there a recompression chamber, and how remote is care?","a":"Since 13 October 2018 Komodo''s gateway has had its own chamber: a hyperbaric oxygen chamber at Siloam Hospitals Labuan Bajo (Flores), the first in East Nusa Tenggara and an eight-patient chamber, so divers no longer have to be flown to Bali first. The fallback remains Sanglah General Hospital in Denpasar, Bali, roughly 1.5 hours by air. Confirm the Labuan Bajo chamber''s 24-hour readiness on your dates with the operator or DAN, and note that the Mount Lewotobi flight disruption can affect the Bali evacuation leg. Komodo''s currents put a premium on conservative profiles and dive-accident insurance.","source":"wetfrogdivers.com/first-hyperbaric-oxygen-chamber-in-komodo + komodoresort.com (accessed 2026-08-09)","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"When is the best time to dive Komodo?","a":"May-October, the Southeast Monsoon dry season, is the popular liveaboard window, with northern waters at 30C and optimal visibility. The cooler southern sites (Manta Alley area) carry more nutrient and colder water; route and month are set by the operator''s north/south plan.","source":"liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","si_tag":"planning"},{"q":"Where do I see mantas in Komodo?","a":"Manta Alley and Manta Point are the named manta sites - cleaning stations and feeding aggregations in current.","source":"liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","si_tag":"liveaboard"},{"q":"What conditions and certification should I plan for?","a":"Castle Rock and Crystal Rock are high-current pinnacle dives suited to experienced divers with reef hooks; sheltered sites and the Sangeang volcanic slopes suit a wider range with a guide. Nitrox is standard on liveaboards. Dive within your certification and the briefing.","source":"liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","si_tag":"liveaboard"},{"q":"Can I see the Komodo dragons on the same trip?","a":"Yes - Komodo National Park pairs the diving with ranger-guided dragon walks on Komodo and Rinca and the Padar viewpoint; most liveaboards include a park day.","source":"liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","si_tag":"globaladv"},{"q":"How far ahead do Komodo liveaboards book?","a":"Peak dry-season (May-October) weeks on preferred vessels fill earliest; hold roughly 3-9 months out for peak windows, nearer term for the shoulder. Confirm per-vessel lead times with the operator.","source":"liveaboard.com/diving/indonesia","si_tag":"planning"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Komodo Liveaboard Diving, Indonesia: Currents, Mantas, Dragons","meta_description":"Komodo dive-liveaboard guide - Castle Rock and Crystal Rock currents, Manta Alley, the May-October dry season, operators, the dragons ashore, and safety.","slug":"komodo-indonesia","primary_keyword":"Komodo liveaboard diving","long_tail":["Castle Rock Komodo","Manta Alley Komodo","Komodo dive season","Komodo dragons dive trip","Komodo liveaboard operators"],"search_language":"id (restated, not machine-translated)","local_keywords":["menyelam Komodo","liveaboard Komodo","Manta Alley"],"hreflang":["en","id"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","content_freshness":"2026-08-09"},"booking":{"bin":"freely bookable (L2)","level":"L2 (Exercise Increased Caution)","codes":["L2"],"consent_flow":false,"note":"US State Dept Level 2, reissued 30 Apr 2025, accessed 2026-08-09 (travel.state.gov/en/.../indonesia.html). ONLY Level 4 (Do Not Travel) carve-outs: Central Papua (Papua Tengah) + Highland Papua (Papua Pegunungan) for civil unrest; Komodo (East Nusa Tenggara) sits well apart. CORRECTION: the earlier ''Central Sulawesi/Poso'' carve-out was in error and is removed. FCDO regional-risks cross-check (gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia/regional-risks, accessed 2026-08-09): advises against all travel within 7km of the crater of Mount Lewotobi Laki-Laki on Flores (erupted 17 Jun 2025, alert level 4, mud/debris-flow warning) + disruption to Bali/Flores flights. Labuan Bajo (Komodo gateway) is on Flores, outside the 7km zone but exposed to flight disruption - stricter access flag, not a Komodo booking bar."},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-08-09","hits":4,"misses":18,"disregarded":3,"note":"Liveaboard-diving scope; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"liveaboard","name":"liveaboard","status":"live"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"future"},{"si":"diveglobal","name":"diveglobal","status":"future"},{"si":"ocean","name":"ocean","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Private-charter luxury phinisi (Dewi Nusantara-class) + Bali pre/post","why_ultra":"the Komodo ultra pull is a private luxury-phinisi or full-boat charter paired with Bali","earning":"held Aggressor reseller line; verify luxury-phinisi charter terms","virtuoso_value_add":"verify - not documented","mor":"commission-on-net; no net-rate resale markup","source":"handoff/LIVEABOARD-OPERATOR-GRID-2026-08-09.md"}],"source_verified":"2026-08-09","hero":{"query":"Komodo, Indonesia"},"geo":{"lat":-8.55,"lng":119.48}}'::jsonb, 4),
